</section><section data-mw-section-id="8" id="mwAS4" aria-labelledby="Further_reading"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Further_reading">Further reading</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Exchange_rate_regime&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8" title="Edit section: Further reading"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<ul id="mwAS8"><li id="mwATA">Edwards, Sebastian &amp; Levy Yeyati, Eduardo (2003) "Flexible Exchange Rates as Shock Absorbers," NBER Working Papers 9867, National Bureau of Economic Research, Inc. (<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ideas.repec.org/p/nbr/nberwo/9867.html" class="external autonumber" id="mwATE"></a>).</li>
